    "body": "- dot-repeat mapping can repeat any plugin-provided operation automatically (without vim-repeat or plugin-specific hacks).\r\n- weird crazy operations like vim-sneak's `dzea`, vim-surround `ds)`, are fully captured in a self-contained atom.\r\n- no more need for `CmdAtom.remap` nor `CmdAtom.pending`.\r\n- simplify the `replay()` idiom.\r\n- better classification of `type=motion`\r\n\r\nref https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/7257",
    "closed_at": "2026-08-22T17:36:27Z",
